    {"text": "Read from the DP map of Jubilife City (1024 x 772 px): 16 px tiles from the top-left corner; the last 4 px rows are left out. Road and paved plaza are walkable; buildings, roofs, trees, planters, lamps, signs, fences and fountains are blocked.", "source": "Bulbapedia DP map"},
    {"text": "Tiles were classified by colour and only those on the story route were checked by eye, so some open plaza next to a lamp or a pattern line may read as blocked.", "source": "Bulbapedia DP map"},
